    "title": "Party for Socialism & Liberation to host data center discussion - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By GAZETTE STAFF ,\n8 hours ago\nJANESVILLE — The Party for Socialism & Liberation is hosting a discussion about what a data center could mean for the city of Janesville at 6 p.m. Thursday at the Hedberg Public Library, 316 S Main St.\nThe group said in a release its goal is to educate the public and discuss what a data center would mean for the city and “what we can do to fight back.”\nA flyer also said that they stop the development of data centers by “joining hands and organizing.”",
